  title="Oil Column Heater vs Panel Heater: Which Suits Your Room?"
  seoTitle="Oil Column Heater vs Panel Heater | Australian Guide"
  description="Compare oil column and panel heaters before buying. Check warm-up time, noise, controls, placement, portability, electricity use and room suitability."
